{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2f477bef8ccb6d535223d8b702d5f3231bed5e3ce4c345e4a20ad6aee459fe0f", "ja": "（星梨花がとあるロックイベントに、ギタリストとして\n出演が決まった。今はその練習期間中なのだが……）", "zh": "（星梨花确定要以吉他手的身份参加某个摇滚活动。现在正处于练习期间，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1001_022ser", "source_sha256": "8726b017bd3da69583ac935808659873ea3d8855046d29f971a87779f3e6027d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、どうしましょう。\nこのままだと、本番で失敗しちゃいそうです……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，怎么办呀。\n这样下去的话，正式演出时感觉会搞砸的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0279827ef8805202dbfaa730b8a3dcdb12249128fff6b60dd4fd921bb04bae57", "ja": "どういうことだ？\n詳しい話を聞いてもいいかな、星梨花。", "zh": "具体是怎么回事？星梨花，能详细说说吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "c56459de51378337a75a4822a772939f49a6ef99b4b30d883ede7d3463fb857a", "ja": "はい……。今回のお仕事、カッコよくしなくちゃ\nいけないのに、どうしてもダメなんです……。", "zh": "是的……这次的工作明明必须表现得很帅气，可我无论如何都做不到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1004_022ser", "source_sha256": "0a568ac35dc23c27254466db6112188c0fbc11243a736270de5d7d47997deaec", "ja": "カッコいいお仕事ができるようになったんだ！って。\nレッスン中も、つい嬉しくて……。", "zh": "我已经能完成帅气的工作了！一想到这里，练习时也总是忍不住开心起来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "9e1b8068ed24a5101aeea5bc78f248a48dd0c5a2ede16127aed6d3aa073c62be", "ja": "気づいたら笑顔になっちゃってるんです……！", "zh": "回过神来就不由得露出笑容了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e5649b4310b43f2af89af5a80d0cfaf03c2e6e004c1134d78485cfeab11734a2", "ja": "笑顔に……。\nいつもなら、それでいいって言うんだけど今回はなぁ。", "zh": "笑容啊……要是平时，我肯定会说这样就好，可这次嘛……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d7e9e554faf3acfa9ea7e8e939f517d9cabf6d804636a85c625273bcdcf943d2", "ja": "仮面のギタリストとして、\nミステリアスなところを見せるから……。", "zh": "因为要以蒙面吉他手的身份，展现神秘的一面……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "2a5d6352a9c1bb0423588b25fbe88b8aad0dd35903cb297c4a6283b5553aa31d", "ja": "はい……。だから、そういうお芝居だと思ってみたん\nですけど。今度は意識しすぎって怒られちゃって……。", "zh": "嗯……所以我试着把它当成那种演戏来做。结果这次又因为太刻意而被骂了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1009_p", "source_sha256": "587f582bd7f36f35a24e406ab7754b47ad4b618507afaa04ba463f7fd0ce809a", "ja": "そ、そうか。うーん……少しずつでも、\nカッコいい姿に慣れていくしかないかな……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。嗯……看来只能慢慢习惯自己帅气的样子了吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "ada834268ba8d6aa189faa873b6aabc556c3f80311f0e09b1aac395b1b8c8a6d", "ja": "カッコいいわたしに……。\n慣れるって、どんなことをするんでしょうか？", "zh": "对帅气的我……  \n要习惯那样的自己，究竟该做些什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1d8b59018ca318425e991ce550e8afb087b8df262be4fe60b68d7ccf825bc489", "ja": "常に、本番と同じ状況を想定してみるんだ。たとえば、\n練習の時も、本番の衣装とギターを使ってみるとか。", "zh": "要随时设想与正式演出一样的情境。比如，\n练习的时候也穿上正式演出的服装、用上正式演出的吉他之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1012_022ser", "source_sha256": "c09069ef40fd6dce80a3d4774c66ce2220ad9e276221c6440187849e1d83830f", "ja": "あっ。そうですね！　練習でちゃんとできるように\nしていけば、本番でも同じようにできますよね！", "zh": "啊。对哦！只要练习时能切实做到，\n正式演出时也能像那样发挥了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "d5420d0fbc43c596bcc2e5eba448cf1b56f853fa4ac2006e0109bce3341b4292", "ja": "わあ～！　{$P$}さん、\nなんだかうまくいきそうな気がしてきました！", "zh": "哇～！{$P$}先生，\n总觉得好像能顺利办到了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "1204048fee63094a8b14bcb6237a8f86d5d9508be73ae54e196a136044cff05e", "ja": "そうだ！　せっかくなら、その間はお洋服や持ち物も\nカッコいいものを用意してみるのはどうでしょうか？", "zh": "对了！既然难得有这个机会，要不要趁这段时间准备一些帅气的衣服和随身物品呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1015_p", "source_sha256": "cc9abc1d01f0fe68792fee560ca062c4fa72132055c8003d69abe9db4dbd6813", "ja": "うん、いいと思うよ。星梨花が\n自然にカッコよくふるまえるように、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "嗯，我觉得挺好的。为了让星梨花能\n自然而然地表现出帅气的一面，我们一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1016_022ser", "source_sha256": "d61fda5b8d6413a667ba02a48faace25bc580d3e71ff15a203537442e3792452", "ja": "えへへ、ありがとうございます♪\nカッコいいギタリストになれるように、がんばります！", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢谢您♪  \n为了成为帅气的吉他手，我会努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_022ser0723_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_022ser0723_1017_p", "source_sha256": "fc83c3bb791149a98bf6e508431650ea61cf57ba6e22d2bf0b3943165850713d", "ja": "（その後「星梨花が変だ」と、ちょっとした騒ぎに\nなったが……本番は大成功！　よかったな星梨花！）", "zh": "（之后，因为“星梨花好奇怪”而引起了一阵小骚动，不过……正式演出大获成功！太好了，星梨花！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
